# TechStart Portfolio Website - Project Kickoff Notes

## Meeting Summary
**Date:** January 15, 2024
**Project:** [[proj:portfolio-website:001|Portfolio Website]]
**Client:** [[org:techstart:001|TechStart Inc.]]
**Attendees:** [[person:sarah:001|Sarah Chen]] (PM), Alex Kumar (TechStart CTO), [[person:emma:001|Emma Thompson]] (Designer), [[person:marcus:001|Marcus Rodriguez]] (Lead Developer)

## Client Requirements
- Modern, professional portfolio website
- Showcase 3-4 key case studies
- Team section with bios and photos
- Blog functionality for thought leadership
- Mobile-first responsive design
- Fast loading and SEO optimized

## Technical Specifications
- **Framework:** Next.js 14 with React 18
- **Styling:** TailwindCSS with custom design system
- **Deployment:** Vercel for optimal performance
- **CMS:** Headless CMS for blog content
- **Animations:** Framer Motion for micro-interactions

## Design Direction
- Clean, minimalist aesthetic with bold typography
- Color palette: Primary (#3B82F6), Secondary (#10B981), Neutral (#1F2937)
- Custom illustrations and icons
- Dark mode support required

## Timeline & Milestones
1. **[[ms:discovery:001|Discovery]]** - Jan 20: Requirements finalized
2. **[[ms:design:001|Design System]]** - Feb 10: Visual framework approved
3. **[[ms:mvp:001|MVP]]** - Mar 25: Core functionality ready
4. **[[ms:content:001|Content]]** - Apr 10: Blog platform integrated
5. **[[ms:launch:001|Launch]]** - Apr 30: Live deployment

